    "text": "By Mark Easson ,\n1 days ago The Winnipeg Jets and the Carolina Hurricanes are having trouble making progress in a Connor Hellebuyck trade. The Fourth Period: Carolina Hurricanes GM Eric Tulsky continues to have contract talks with Alexander Nikishin, as well as trade talks with some teams. Nikishin is looking for a change of scenery. He made $925,000 last year and is looking for a big raise. Read full article",
